#: ../../source/janim/render/motion_blur.rst:2
msgid "motion_blur"
msgstr "motion_blur"

#: janim.render.motion_blur.MotionBlurBuffer:1 of
msgid "将各次采样的完整场景累加到浮点纹理中"
msgstr "Accumulate the complete scene of every sample into a float texture"

#: janim.render.motion_blur.MotionBlurBuffer:3 of
msgid ""
"各样本先渲染到离屏 framebuffer，再以预乘透明度累加进浮点累积纹理。 最终平均值会被绘制到调用方当前绑定的 framebuffer 上，"
" 因此同一份代码对 Qt 窗口、``capture`` 与 ``VideoWriter`` 都适用"
msgstr ""
"Samples are rendered into an offscreen framebuffer and accumulated into a floating-point "
"texture with premultiplied alpha. The final average is drawn onto whichever framebuffer the "
"caller currently has bound, so the same code works for the Qt widget, ``capture`` and "
"``VideoWriter``."

#: janim.render.motion_blur.MotionBlurBuffer.resolve:1 of
msgid "将平均后的结果绘制到当前绑定的 framebuffer 上"
msgstr "Draw the averaged result onto the currently bound framebuffer"
